ontent-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">En Tellus no creemos en venderte humo. Enseñamos desde lo esencial:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://blog.telluscoop.com/p/qu-es-una-blockchain\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">¿Qué es una blockchain?</a></span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://blog.telluscoop.com/p/comocomprarxlm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">¿Cómo funciona una wallet?</a></span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://blog.telluscoop.com/p/stellarremesas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">¿Qué diferencia a Stellar de otras redes?</a></span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Nuestros contenidos parten de cero y están pensados para personas de Latinoamérica, con ejemplos cercanos y sin tecnicismos innecesarios.</span></p></div><div class=\"p-4\"><div class=\"mx-auto\" style=\"max-width:520px\"><div class=\"relative w-full h-0\" style=\"padding-bottom:56.25%\"><iframe class=\"absolute top-0 left-0\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/YyVG1MSrL2w\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" title=\"Youtube embed\"></iframe></div></div></div><div id=\"2-crea-tu-wallet-en-stellar-es-open\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">2. Crea tu wallet en Stellar (¡es open source!)</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Una buena forma de aprender es </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>haciendo</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">. Te invitamos a:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Probar nuestra </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Tellus-Cooperative\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">wallet cooperativa open source</a></span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Crear tu cuenta y comenzar a explorar cómo se hacen transacciones reales en Stellar</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Explorar herramientas como </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://stellarx.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">StellarX</a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> o </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://lobstr.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">LOBSTR</a></span></p></div></li></ul></div><div id=\"3-nete-a-nuestras-sesiones-y-espaci\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">3. Únete a nuestras sesiones y espacios</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">La comunidad es clave. En nuestra </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"Telluscoop.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">Cooperativa</a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Hacemos talleres en línea</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Organizamos espacios para resolver dudas</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Trabajamos en proyectos reales donde puedes aportar</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Además, puedes contribuir en GitHub aunque estés aprendiendo, porque creemos que todxs pueden sumar desde su nivel.</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-container=\"true\" class=\"_8dv9ja0\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Tellus-Cooperative\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja2\" style=\"--generic-embed-image-width:40%\"><div data-generic-embed-layout=\"true\" class=\"border-collapse w-full flex sm:flex-row flex-col\"><div data-generic-embed-image-wrapper=\"true\" data-generic-embed-image-left=\"true\" class=\"w-full mb-[20px] sm:mb-0 sm:mr-[20px] sm:w-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] sm:basis-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] flex\" style=\"align-self:center\"><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/09e72a60-4acf-44e7-a622-931ea682c8c9/Frame_1296.png?t=1747575883\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover\" alt=\"\"></div><div class=\"_8dv9ja1\"><div data-generic-embed-title=\"true\" class=\"rq7pc90\"><p class=\"rq7pc91\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Tellus-Cooperative</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-description=\"true\" class=\"_1uh4x2v0\"><p class=\"_1uh4x2v2\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Contamos con 6 repositorios Open-Source, únete y contribuye!</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-host=\"true\" class=\"efatai0\"><p class=\"efatai1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">github.com/Tellus-Cooperative</span></p></div></div></div></div></a></div><div id=\"4-haz-preguntas-propn-rompe-cosas\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">4. Haz preguntas, propón, rompe cosas</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Aprender blockchain no es solo leer: es </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>experimentar</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">En nuestra cooperativa valoramos la curiosidad, el ensayo-error y las ganas de construir algo que sirva a las personas, no solo a los mercados.</span></p></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"listx-para-dar-el-primer-paso\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¿Listx para dar el primer paso?</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Únete a nuestra comunidad y empecemos este camino juntxs.</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Desde Stellar, desde Latinoamérica, desde la cooperación.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">📚 Lee la primera parte:</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">👉 </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://blog.telluscoop.com/p/por-qu-aprender-blockchain-con-nosotros-de-qu-te-sirve-y-por-qu-aprender-sobre-stellar-dc9f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">Por qué aprender blockchain con nosotros (y por qué Stellar)</a></span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-container=\"true\" class=